WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.440
When a helper changes, an example or
explanation can miss the same update.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.713
This guide names the greeting helper.

3
00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:14.150
Docs drift compares their history and
finds a newer commit on the code.

4
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.400
You get both the document
and the change to look at.

5
00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.506
Read the guide against
the code before editing.

6
00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:32.007
The report gives you the place to start.
